    "title": "What National Day Is Today? Today's Holidays (April 23, 2026) | Days Of The Year",
    "text": "Your guide to every national day and holiday on April 23, 2026.Want to have a blast on a unique holiday? Start your day with a picnic in the park, munching on English muffins and cherry cheesecake. Celebrate German Beer Day with a cold one, and challenge a friend to a game of table tennis. Take a break to read a book outside, maybe even in a different language. Channel your inner Shakespeare and speak in Old English for a laugh.Spend quality time with your kids, teaching them about money management and reading their favorite bedtime story. Don’t forget your furry friend – learn pet CPR just in case. Watch a movie or head to the theater for a film in Spanish or English. Express your creativity through writing or science experiments.Embrace the spirit of adventure by trying new foods like asparagus or taking a chance on something different. Show love to those around you, whether it’s celebrating your relationship or appreciating your own body. Help raise awareness for lost pets and support girls in tech.End your day stargazing in Iceland or by creating your own mini celebration. The key is to have fun, be open to new experiences, and appreciate the little moments. So go ahead, make the most of these unusual holidays and create a day to remember!",
